### 1. Get Current Occupancy
# Returns the latest reported status (e.g., "MEDIUM")
GET http://localhost:8080/checkIn/library-level2-quiet/occupancy
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get Time Since Last Update
# Returns a number representing seconds since the last report
GET http://localhost:8080/checkIn/library-level2-quiet/last-update
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get 7-Day Average
# Returns the calculated average occupancy for the week
GET http://localhost:8080/checkIn/library-level2-quiet/average-occupancy
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Submit a User Check-In (Report Status)
# Logic: Updates the room status in the database.
# Make sure the room ID exists in Atlas.
POST http://localhost:8080/checkIn/library-level2-quiet/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "occupancy": "HIGH",
  "comment": "Very busy today, hard to find a desk near a window.",
  "anonymous": true
}

###

### 5. Submit Check-In for Engineering Room
POST http://localhost:8080/checkIn/engineering-1-12/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "occupancy": "LOW",
  "comment": "Plenty of space available right now.",
  "anonymous": false
}